  "bodyHash": "f8523d2940e40dc6",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmanage%252faff.php%253faff%253d372\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpeKQZQ.png\" alt=\"Supplementaries Mod\" width=\"1519\" height=\"855\"></a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[![Supplementaries Discord](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv</a>) [![Support me on Patreon](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar</a>) [![Supplementaries Twitter](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbadges.penpow.dev%252fbadges%252fsocial%252ftwitter-plural%252fcozy.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez</a>) [![Youtube Channel](<a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Supplementaries 是一个高度可配置的 Forge 模组，专注于添加有价值的游戏内容以填补原版游戏的空白。其功能设计注重实用性、美学兼容性以及与现有内容的互补性，为提升你的“原版+”游戏体验提供了多种新方式。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组需要 <strong>Moonlight Library</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">虽然支持 Fabric 版本，但由于该模组主要面向 Forge，Fabric 版本可能会缺少一些次要功能</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以自由地将此模组包含在你的整合包中</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;以下语言已翻译：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Deutsch | Polski | Fran&ccedil;ais | Русский | Italiano | English | Če&scaron;tina | 한국어 | Українська | Portugu&ecirc;s | Српски | Espa&ntilde;ol | Қазақ | Bahasa Melayu | Pirate Speech | 简体中文 (中国) | 繁體中文 (香港) | 繁體中文 (台灣) | T&uuml;rk&ccedil;e</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🖼️ 媒体资料 🖼️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">预告片：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZTN_DWP5d3o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在此查看一些评测</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>其他评测：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1r07kI3xrOg</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组花费了我大量时间，如果你喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以通过以下方式资助。如果你这样做，你将获得专属定制的 <strong>地球仪</strong> 和/或 <strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，也同样适用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？看看 Akliz，他们提供专为模组版 Minecraft 打造的高品质品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有非常温馨的玩家社区，提供出色的技术支持，服务器性能卓越。<br>使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享 <strong>8 折优惠</strong>，同时也间接支持了我！</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fsupplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❓ 常见问题 ❓</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：如何禁用/调整 X 功能？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/Supplementaries/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wiki</strong></a> 中的自定义部分，或加入我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fqdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：你能更新/降级到 X 版本吗？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;我计划最终将该模组移植到每个新的主要 Minecraft 版本，请耐心等待。<br>至于降级，绝对不行，我对支持过时且废弃的版本不感兴趣。维护当前这一个版本已经占用了我大量的时间，而且不同版本之间的变化巨大，如果要支持旧版本，我几乎需要重新学习如何制作模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：你能添加 X 功能/方块吗？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 我鼓励你加入我们的 Discord。我们有一个专门用于建议的板块。如果我觉得你的想法足够契合，它最终被加入的可能性就很高。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：如何使用 X 方块/物品？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> 再次请参阅 <strong>Wiki</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：如何修复此问题/崩溃？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;请在 Issues（问题）板块提交报告，务必包含 <strong>崩溃日志 (Crash Report)</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>问：Fabric 版本缺少 X</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>答：</strong> Supplementaries 主要是一个 Forge 模组。如果某些功能缺失，这意味着它没有简单或容易的实现方式，因为 Fabric 缺少 Forge API 提供的某些对应组件，而这些组件是该功能所重度依赖的。更多信息请查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fJdipbyU.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢 🏆</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">许多人已为该模组贡献了素材和纹理，名单过于庞大无法在此全部列出。然而，要在游戏中直接查看他们，请将一本名为 “credits<em>”</em> 的书写入告示牌中。</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，部分音效来自 Zapsplat，特此致谢<br><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vista\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1488/645/638967363014143781.gif\" alt=\"Vista\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/997/638414771733478975.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/992/638414764957723804.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"Sleep Tight\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/931/583/638405407858849835.png\" alt=\"Polytone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"Heartstone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/878/615/638305506575137108.png\" alt=\"Map Atlases\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/936/946/638414707400791480.png\" alt=\"Universal Sawmill\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></span></span></p>",
